            "review_title": "Review at El Cafe Vegan Vegetarian Food",
            "review_text": "soda4077\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam83 contributions\n0\nWorst food in Saigon\nMay 2020 • Family\nThe Momos were undercooked and clumpy. The quesadillas were dry, tasteless, unevenly cut, the worst I have seen or tasted. The French fries were double or triple fried, hard, oily, over done. Most average street side places can do better food. The delivery took more than 60 minutes. No one picks up at the restaurant. The food is very expensive for what it is. These guys have no clue on what they are cooking or pretending to cook and serve. The chef and management really need do a tour to learn about how some of these simple dishes are cooked. Don't waste your time money!!!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 17, 2020",
