            "review_title": "Review at El Cafe Vegan Vegetarian Food",
            "review_text": "Elly\nGothenburg, Sweden260 contributions\n3\nGreat food\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nThis might not be the cheapest place where you can grab some good vegan or vegetarian food but the service is great and the owner throws together a great salad. I've been craving a fresh salad for quite some time and was happy to have stumbled upon this place. Watch out for the dressing, it's a tad on the sweet side. Right! The owner speaks really good English.\nRead more\nWritten February 5, 2019\nKayjus\nHi Elisa,\n\nThanks for your valuable review))\n\nWell, we selling dishes between from 1$ to 3.5$ and some huge platters are 4.5$. Honestly we running this place since last year September 2018 and we haven't made any profit from this branch yet. Our main focus is to get acknowledge our customer about our creativity of art of cooking vegan/vegetarian food and make sure that every visit would be value for money.\n\nWe hope to see you again))\n\nHave a great time.\nRead more\nWritten February 10, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
