            "review_title": "Review at El Cafe Vegan Vegetarian Food",
            "review_text": "Tim S\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam194 contributions\n4\nExcellent Choice of vegan food\nNov 2018 • Friends\nThe biggest problem was deciding which things to have as I could easily have picked 30 different things. The choices I had, a dahl and paneer bread were excellent. The blueberry plant milk shake was great also. I went at lunchtime when no other places on the food court were open so if you want a quiet meal it is an ideal time. There’s a stage and performances on a weekend evening so it will be livelier. The owner is very friendly and knowledgeable about veganism. Prices are very reasonable. I would definitely recommend giving this place a try.\nRead more\nWritten November 10, 2018",
