            "review_text": "Alena S\nColorado Springs, Colorado28 contributions\n3\nSimply fantastic\nNov 2018 • Solo\nI've known El Cafe from their first location in Mui Ne and I've been their devoted customer. In Saigon they're located on the grounds of the zoo - you need to enter the zoo and find a food court. Extensive - I mean that - menu, very nicely presented with actual photos and ingredients. Pure vegan, healthy, but at the same time flavorful and mouthwatering food; unhackneyed recipes along with international classic. Extremely friendly and well trained staff (English speaking!!). They've gone extra mile in being conscious and environment friendly; if you order a drink you'd been asked whether you need a straw or not. Great job, guys! \nP.S. I was going to post some photos of the food too... it was too tempting and I demolished it too fast. :)\nRead more\nWritten November 6, 2018",
